# Previewing an edit
@scenario tutorial_lesson_27
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg room]
[char ginger global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[show ginger guide thoughtful]
ginger: Let's change my expression without replaying the whole scene. Put the cursor on the line you want to see.
ginger: Place the cursor on this line, open Puppeteer, then return to the source and change the pose.
> Review question -> check
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label check
ginger: What should you keep aligned while checking an edit?
> The cursor beat in the editor and the runtime scene state. -> correct
> Only the file modification time. -> retry
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label retry
[show ginger guide confused]
ginger: A different scene state can make an unchanged edit look wrong. Give it another try.
[jump check]
@label correct
[show ginger guide normal]
ginger: A different scene state can make an unchanged edit look wrong.
> Back to topics -> return_hub
> Replay example -> start
@label return_hub
[if !tutorial_done_27]
[flag tutorial_done_27]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_6]
